      "statement": "ClientMessage is a protobuf oneof envelope with three variants: send_offer_message (answer_peer_id, offer_sdp), send_answer_message (offer_peer_id, answer_sdp), and send_ice_candidate_message (peer_id, candidate). The orphaned update_peer_metadata_message variant was removed from the wire format.",
