    {
      "id": "claim_fc485b5fc851457b9c9fc2f63bbdf7e9",
      "statement": "ICE candidates are individually signaled (trickle ICE): the shared armSendOnIceReady helper used by sendOffer/sendAnswer forwards every onicecandidate candidate via sendIceCandidateToWebsocket (including candidates arriving after the SDP went out), flushes the SDP on the gathering-complete event or as a fallback after the waitIceCandidatesTimeout timer (default 2000 ms), and uses a single isSent guard so the SDP itself is sent exactly once.",
