      "id": "claim_af1687183859403b8088b23626e9132e",
      "statement": "hub.HandleMessage's read loop terminates on read errors, non-binary frames, or protobuf unmarshal failures (logging the exit error); after it returns, the WebSocket upgrade path closes the peer and runs RemovePeerIfLast to tear the peer down.",
